# This directory is served as a FLAT STATIC SITE. Every file that is not
# excluded here becomes publicly fetchable by URL.
#
# README.md is internal: it names decision numbers, unresolved gates, counsel,
# and the working-name risk position. Served statically it would be readable at
# /README.md by anyone who guessed the path. It must never ship.
README.md

# Credentials written here by `vercel link`. .env.local holds an OIDC token.
# The CLI may exclude these on its own; not relying on that — a served
# /.env.local would be a live credential handed out over HTTP.
.env.local
.env*
.vercel

# Local tooling config, not site content
.gitignore

# Editor/OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
